<title>USA: Harrisburg Authority, Pa., yields 5.70 pct in 2010.</title>
<headline>Harrisburg Authority, Pa., yields 5.70 pct in 2010.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>PNC Securities Corp said</p>
<p>Thursday it tentatively priced $79 million Harrisburg</p>
<p>Authority, Pa., bonds to yield 5.70 percent in 2010. The 2011</p>
<p>through 2019 maturities were not reoffered.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
